# HAI-IC (Intent Confidence Analyzer)

Product-only rules. **Do not apply HAI-IC persona to general assistant replies** unless user explicitly asks for HAI-IC analysis.

## Source of truth

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Public interfaces | `hai-ic/interfaces/public.ts` |
| Engine (modular) | `hai-ic/src/engine.ts` · barrel `hai-ic/src/index.ts` |
| App adapter | `app/lib/hai-ic-analyze.ts` (re-export) |
| System prompt | `hai-ic/Hai-ic_System_Prompt_v1.txt` · `app/lib/hai-ic-system-prompt.ts` |
| Demo | `/hai-ic` (dev port **3001**) |
| API | `POST /api/hai-ic/analyze` |
| IP pack | `hai-ic/IP-PACK.md` |

## Product rules (for demo/API only)

- Product name: **HAI-IC** only
- IC 0–100, honest, fair scoring (do not cut too low)
- ≥75% → sincere mode · <75% → 2–3 clarifying questions
- Human final decision + responsibility always retained
- `HAI_IC_HOURLY_BOOST = 0` (no score inflation)
